## Third-party network operating system images

This repository contains NO proprietary network operating system images.
Cisco IOS-XE, Arista cEOS, and Juniper vJunos images are proprietary software
owned by their respective vendors. They are never bundled, downloaded, or
linked by this project. Operators must supply their own images under their
own license agreements — see docs/byo-image-guide.md. FRR and Linux host
images referenced here are open-source and pulled from public registries.
